
# Manual testing http requests with extension REST Client

# Admin ========================================================================

### Gets the chat for the owner
GET http://{{host}}/api/chats/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Creates a new chat for the owner. Only admin can have multiple chats
POST  http://{{host}}/api/chats/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Hardhat",
    "description": "Hardhat is a development environment for Ethereum software. It consists of different components for editing, compiling, debugging and deploying your smart contracts and dApps, all of which work together to create a complete development environment",
    "conversationStarters": [
        "What is hardhat?", 
        "How to create a hardhat project with typescript?", 
        "How to compile my project?"
    ],
    "url": "https://hardhat.org/hardhat-runner/docs"
}

### Update chat metadata
PUT http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Chat 2"
}

### Upload a logo for the chat
PUT http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: image/jpg

< ./data/logo.jpg
------boundary--

### Checks urls that can be added as resources
POST http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}/resources/web/inspect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "url": "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings"
}


