### Add a web resource
POST http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}/resources/web
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "web",
    "urls": [
 "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/openai",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/google-gemini",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/cohere",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/hugging-face",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/google-palm",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/hugging-face-embedding-server",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/instructor",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/roboflow-api",
    "https://docs.trychroma.com/embeddings/jinaai"
    
    
    
    
    
  ]
}

### Delete resource
DELETE http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}/resources/662fb7a802f5056e3ebd60ff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Test ========================================================================

### Gets the chat for the consumer
GET http://{{host}}/api/chats/published

### Gets the chat for the consumer
GET http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}

### Generate response for question
POST http://{{host}}/api/chats/{{chat_id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What is chromadb?",
    "chatHistory": []
}
